"ce que tu m’entends, Morgana... ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_992E7B91_DD8C_4CFF_BE91_EDCFE80267E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 865b0495f617b509b87ca6a2d57681d0dea6a1fbed4f42155fffaa2e5b7de73d
