msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_992E7B91_DD8C_4CFF_BE91_EDCFE80267E8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I can hear you just fine, my dear.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Now, what brings you all the way "
"up here?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Je t’entends très bien, mon cher.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Allons, qu’est-ce qui t’amène "
"jusqu’ici ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_871311D2_CE60_4D24_BA59_92D10EF42D9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb063752ce17a882a0879522d944b7979f85940998a079ade4c50585afa0d09b
#. default-sha256: 861e0ed82959bb2d4ecce0c2fd3fe9822d6dd60e51a4001fa227906fc6ad4ec3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_871311D2_CE60_4D24_BA59_92D10EF42D9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You know you can call me from anywhere in the house.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My bonds to this tower have "
"been broken."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tu sais que tu peux m’appeler de n’importe quel endroit de la maison.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mes liens "
"avec cette tour ont été brisés."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E05ECFDB_24A1_463F_AB5C_00E1A7656DB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fd708f934ba32de86c23256abe68c980e338b4486365c91b5611463be4afccb
