#: scenario7:scenario7_CA3F6677_C063_4924_BF31_AA028A2DFDB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aaa47b57194f9e54c941cb6c5128ec421930679beffbef38d6baafc0d4e519ff
