#: scenario7:scenario7_EBF8C076_5FC9_4BA2_A55A_73FC3D5FB75E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b4aa8f01fcf155ec7a9ffcf01fb84b2f715db551eb0d4569f974422cf6b2f60
