msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m sorry, Michel, but we are kindred spirits—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫as much as you may "
"want to deny it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je suis désolée, Michel, mais nous sommes des âmes sœurs —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫quels que "
"soient tes efforts pour le nier."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D560EA69_8C29_4F9A_96ED_EF2EDD23F22A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4421315e5296ef87a7a07eb4ee291dd93ee18bb26504716f0a8a636c77017145
#. default-sha256: d249364a9e31c9c99b5c895392e306e1227f69957025247ecde3c2e9fc832bef
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D560EA69_8C29_4F9A_96ED_EF2EDD23F22A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You could be second to only God, yet you spurn His gift."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tu pourrais être le second de Dieu, et pourtant tu rejettes Son don."

#: scenario7:scenario7_47F1DACD_3876_4775_99A0_E5423BACC6D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42108dd051d9f828e0af1a157a3bbe706d23ae66117b8588dc9ad4446db8e8dc
#. default-sha256: 21063829852dcb4b6dfd20fb1cbb77b508352c2e972ad4beb7feb460ebb74801
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_47F1DACD_3876_4775_99A0_E5423BACC6D6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I am nothing like you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I am a human... ⟪k:4⟫nothing more."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je ne suis pas du tout comme toi.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Je suis humain... ⟪k:4⟫rien de plus."

#: scenario7:scenario7_EF62B65E_16C7_4FCC_9043_63A39C0D7251
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ade026217ccca2344116d0ebcc523f1a53c662cdfe3c076d495a1bced54527d
