#: scenario7:scenario7_180E9105_D7F5_4671_98F6_65D3AADBD25C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52a9ceae0601bcb7d6de5c36a88c7ef0b2b49ba62a2b8ff922df4b7aea50e952
#. default-sha256: 633746703cf664386d3fbf29c87475ca34cea76e2c9440d67462a9cc780ccfa1
